 result←object Put arg;cbits;new;at
 cbits←object._pic ##.##.∆WG'CBits' ⍝ The Bitmap child will always exist
 arg←##.##.Single arg
 '∆WI RANK ERROR: Put'##.##.Error 1≠≢⍴arg
 '∆WI LENGTH ERROR: Put'##.##.Error~1 3∊⍨≢arg
 new←⊃arg ⋄ at←2↑1↓arg,0 0
 new←new⍴⍨¯2↑1 1,⍴new ⍝ Force to be a matrix
 '∆WI DOMAIN ERROR: Put'##.##.Error~##.##.IsInt new
 '∆WI DOMAIN ERROR: Put'##.##.Error~##.##.IsNum at
 '∆WI DOMAIN ERROR: Put'##.##.Error∨/∨/new<0
 '∆WI DOMAIN ERROR: Put'##.##.Error∨/at<0
 at←(⍴new),⍨⌊0.5+at×⊃##._supp.MyUnits object ⍝ Convert scaled arg to whole pixels
 '∆WI DOMAIN ERROR: Put'##.##.Error∨/cbits⍴⍛<+⌿2 2⍴at
 (at[3 4]↑at[1 2]↓cbits)←256⊥⊖(3⍴256)⊤new ⍝ Replace just those pixels
 object._pic ##.##.∆WS⊂'CBits'cbits
 result←##.NoRes
